{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03157","headline":"城南隅山池春中田袁二公盛称其美夏首获赏果会夙言故有此咏 · 张九龄","name":"城南隅山池春中田袁二公盛称其美夏首获赏果会夙言故有此咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昨闻佳境，驾言寻昔蹊。\n非惟初物变，亦与旧游暌。\n幽渚爲君说，清晨即我携。\n途深独睥睨，历险共攀跻。\n林笋苞青箨，津杨委绿荑。\n荷香初出浦，草色复缘堤。\n乐处将鸥狎，谭端用马齐。\n且言临海郡，兼话武陵溪。\n异壤风烟绝，空山岩迳迷。\n如何际朝野，从此待金闺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}